# GMS steals a potion from whatever you hit, and a potion stolen from a boss
# gives a buff worth 30 attack. Nothing here drinks anything, so only the buff
# is left, kept permanently, reaching GMS's 30 at the top of the ladder.
name: "Steal"
description: "Increases your Attack Power."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BANDIT skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 10
base { attack: 3 }
per_level { attack: 3 }
